OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 4 JUN
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Arthur Bliss
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod with biographer
OL,6,     GPaul Spicer delve into Bliss's
OL,7,     Gmusic during WWII and after,
OL,8,     Gincluding his appointment as
OL,9,     GMaster of the Queen's Music.
OL,10,G1700FIn Tune
OL,11,     GPetroc introduces live music from
OL,12,     Gthe Scottish Chamber Orchestra
OL,13,     Gcello ensemble ahead of the
OL,14,     GScottish Chamber Orchestra's
OL,15,     Gsummer tour.
OL,16,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,17,     GHalf an hour of back-to-back
OL,18,     Gclassical music, including works
OL,19,     Gby Bach, Mozart and Amy Beach.
